      "detailed_description": "Wrap your head (and cable) around Robot Detour’s numerous puzzles!<br>Deliver batteries to your robot friends, avoid enemies and gain a deeper understanding of the intricate rules and mechanisms of the game’s world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666840/extras/c0bfa26423f3c9f7680749f63ff261c6.poster.avif?t=1765877083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666840/extras/c0bfa26423f3c9f7680749f63ff261c6.webm?t=1765877083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666840/extras/c0bfa26423f3c9f7680749f63ff261c6.mp4?t=1765877083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 worlds with unique puzzles and mechanics where you’ll find:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>easy levels<br></li><li>challenging levels<br></li><li>funny levels<br></li><li>weird levels<br></li><li>fish</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666840/extras/5b7df0c8aae7373d5da9c382bf7c68eb.avif?t=1765877083\" width=683 height=145 /></span>",
      "about_the_game": "Wrap your head (and cable) around Robot Detour’s numerous puzzles!<br>Deliver batteries to your robot friends, avoid enemies and gain a deeper understanding of the intricate rules and mechanisms of the game’s world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666840/extras/c0bfa26423f3c9f7680749f63ff261c6.poster.avif?t=1765877083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666840/extras/c0bfa26423f3c9f7680749f63ff261c6.webm?t=1765877083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666840/extras/c0bfa26423f3c9f7680749f63ff261c6.mp4?t=1765877083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 worlds with unique puzzles and mechanics where you’ll find:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>easy levels<br></li><li>challenging levels<br></li><li>funny levels<br></li><li>weird levels<br></li><li>fish</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666840/extras/5b7df0c8aae7373d5da9c382bf7c68eb.avif?t=1765877083\" width=683 height=145 /></span>",
      "short_description": "А fun and innovative puzzle game about a wired robot who delivers batteries to his wireless friends.",
      "supported_languages": "English, German, Russian, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian, Turkish",
      "reviews": "“The best puzzles I’ve seen in several months!”<br>Aliensrock<br><br>“It's not often you're actively encouraged to make a mess with the leads and wires of electronic devices, so there's something immediately enticing about this single-screen puzzle game.”<br>EDGE Magazine<br><br>“Great extension cord puzzler, wrapping yourself around semi-complicated walls and bricks to avoid spike traps to deliver batteries to robots. Progressive hints, clean design, fab controls. Rewarding!”<br>8.5 – Higher Plain Games<br>",
